OL,4,BDid Springboks win change the          
OL,5,Bnarrative for Ireland?                 
OL,6,GTen months out from the World Cup,     
OL,7,GIreland needed to make a statement.    
OL,9,FThey had lost their last six matches   
OL,10,Fagainst South Africa, New Zealand and  
OL,11,FFrance, and questions were starting to 
OL,12,Fbe asked if this was an Irish team     
OL,13,Fpast their best.                       
OL,15,FA year ago, South Africa had           
OL,16,Fdemolished the Irish scrum on their    
OL,17,Fway to a 24-13 win in Dublin.          
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
