OL,4,BFifa president Infantino pays tribute  
OL,5,Bto Coyle                               
OL,6,GFifa president Gianni Infantino has    
OL,7,Gpaid tribute to legendary Irish League 
OL,8,Gmanager Roy Coyle, who passed away     
OL,9,Gaged 80.                               
OL,11,FCoyle, who died on Friday, won 13      
OL,12,Fleague titles during his 32-year       
OL,13,Fmanagerial career, achieving periods   
OL,14,Fof sustained success with Linfield and 
OL,15,FGlentoran.                             
OL,17,FHe also managed Ards, Derry City and   
OL,18,FNewry City and had a spell as          
OL,19,FGlentoran director of football.        
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
