OL,4,BScotstown through to Ulster final      
OL,5,Bafter shootout win                     
OL,6,GA classic Ulster club football semi-   
OL,7,Gfinal went the way of Scotstown, who   
OL,8,Gcame through 4-2 on penalties against  
OL,9,GSt Eunan's at Brewster Park.           
OL,11,FAt one stage, the Monaghan side led by 
OL,12,Feight points in normal time, but were  
OL,13,Fpegged back and it was level at 1-24   
OL,14,Fto 0-27 after extra time with neither  
OL,15,Fside giving an inch.                   
OL,17,FScotstown will now face the winners of 
OL,18,FSunday's second semi-final between     
OL,19,FCrossmaglen and Edendork in the Ulster 
OL,20,FClub final, which is scheduled for the 
OL,21,Fweekend of 6 December.                 
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
