OL,4,BKicker Smyth elevated to Saints'       
OL,5,Bplaying roster                         
OL,6,GKicker Charlie Smyth has been elevated 
OL,7,Gto the New Orleans Saints' playing     
OL,8,Groster and has signed a new deal with  
OL,9,Gthe NFL franchise.                     
OL,11,FThe former gaelic footballer, from     
OL,12,FMayobridge in Northern Ireland, has    
OL,13,Fstarted the last two NFL games for the 
OL,14,FSaints after being promoted from the   
OL,15,Fpractice squad.                        
OL,17,FThe 25-year-old was handed a second    
OL,18,Fopportunity to be the Saints' kicker   
OL,19,Fafter Dan Carlson, who started the     
OL,20,Fseason as first choice, was released   
OL,21,Fat the start of November due to mixed  
OL,22,Fform.                             G4/4 
